<title>UK: Wellington Hldgs H1 pre-tax up slightly.</title>
<headline>Wellington Hldgs H1 pre-tax up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		8.31		   vs 6.85</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.7		    vs 2.4</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.9		    vs 2.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   30.5		   vs 31.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Wellington Holdings Plc, which is a maker of polymer-based products, said it is now in a position to consider potential strategic acquisitions, and expects growth to continue.</p>
<p> Operating result	 3.1		    vs 2.7</p>
<p> Exceptional		nil		    vs 0.2 loss</p>
<p> Interest		   0.2		    vs 0.2</p>
<p> Tax			  0.9		    vs 0.7</p>
<p> Net taxed		  2.0		    vs 1.6</p>
<p> Attributable	     1.3		    vs 1.1</p>
<p> Pay date		   Nov 5</p>
<p>Div registration date  Sept 24</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
